<article class="env-lemma" id="020J">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/020J">Lemma <span data-tag="020J">33.8.3</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a scheme over a separably closed field $k$. If $X$ is irreducible, then $X_ K$ is irreducible for any field extension $K/k$. I.e., $X$ is geometrically irreducible over $k$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Use Properties, Lemma <a href="/tag/01OM" data-tag="01OM">28.3.3</a> and Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/00I7" data-tag="00I7">10.47.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>